adorare et colere, et omnem superstitiosam sectam
 <NOTE N="(254)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0062" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0062D"></COL> I. e. vitae rationem.</NOTE>  ac sacrilegos ritus <NOTE N="145" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0061" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0061"></COL> ritus  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  usus 1.</NOTE>  instituit et docuit;
