construxit, et ex suo nomine eam <NOTE N="154" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0061" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0061"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>  Lubossin <NOTE N="155" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0061" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0061"></COL> Lubosin
