equitat in <NOTE N="841" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0091"></COL> suam  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  3.</NOTE>  dulcem patriam, et ut pervenit ad <NOTE N="842" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0091"></COL> sanctam  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  4.</NOTE> 
