 <POEM COM="0135"><L>Plura referre pudet de tantae <NOTE N="1694" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> detente  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr. al. man.</HI>  detantae 1.</NOTE>  nobilitatis</L> <L>Morte repentina nec scriptis promere digna.</L></POEM> 

Tanta enim nobilium ibi <NOTE N="1695" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">omittunt</HI>  2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>  facta est strages virorum,
quanta nec in campis Emathiae <NOTE N="1696" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> Amathiae 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(461)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135C"></COL> Lucan., Pharsal. I, 1.</NOTE> , nec
in tempore Sillae, nec aliqua <NOTE N="1697" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> aquila
2.</NOTE>  mortalium peste,
nec hostili unquam gladio <NOTE N="1698" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  3.</NOTE> , fertur simul Teutonicorum
interisse nobilitas. Interea caesar sedens
montis in supercilio, suae mentis fallitur augurio.
Nam dum suos vinci non aestimat ab hoste, victores
 <COL N="0136A"></COL> ut vidit adesse cruentos, insiliens tergo sonipedis
 <NOTE N="1699" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> semipedis A, 1, 2, 3.</NOTE> , incumbit jubis et</P> <P COM="0136">Admovet <NOTE N="1700" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> t  <HI REND="ITALIC">alia manus minio superscr.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  lumbis calcar quadrupedis caesar;
quem nisi habuisset promptum, eadem hora descendisset
in orcum sine mora Romanus imperator <NOTE N="(462)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135C"></COL> De Heinrici clade die 22 m. Aug. 1040 facta,
 <COL N="0136C"></COL> cfr. Hermann Aug. et Ann. Sang. majores.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0136">11. Dum haec ibi geruntur, Saxones cum duce
Okardo <NOTE N="1701" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> Okarado 1.</NOTE>  de quo supra dixi, Boemiam ingrediuntur
et unam parvam regionem, quae est circa fluvium
 <NOTE N="1702" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">omittit</HI>  4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  Belinam <NOTE N="1703" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> fluvium quae est circa Belinam 2, 2 <SUP>a</SUP> , fluvium, qui est circa Belinam 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , hostiliter demoliuntur. Interea
dux eorum famam ut percepit sinistram, Sclavos
de caesare habuisse victoriam, fixit <NOTE N="1704" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> fecit
 <HI REND="ITALIC">corr. al. manu</HI>  fixit A.</NOTE>  gradum ad
pontem Gnevin <NOTE N="1705" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> Gneum 3. Ghnevin 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(463)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0136" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0136C"></COL> Gnenin, Brux, ad Bilam in circulo Satzensi;
cf. Pubitschka III, 319.</NOTE>  juxta fluvium Belinam
 <NOTE N="1706" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> Bilinam 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> , valde sollicitus utrum bello fortunam temptaret,
an cum <NOTE N="1707" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> de  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  4.</NOTE>  tanto dedecore <NOTE N="1708" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> dolore 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  repatriaret. Maluit
tamen prius experiri <NOTE N="1709" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> experire  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  experiri A. 1.</NOTE>  animum ducis, et per nuncios
 <COL N="0136B"></COL> temptans eum verbis suadet amicis:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Qui te
modo pugnando</HI> <NOTE N="1710" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> pugnare 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vicisse gaudes, si supplicando vicisses,
melior multo</HI> <NOTE N="1711" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">al. manu superscr.</HI>  A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">victor</HI> <NOTE N="1712" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">omissum</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fuisses; propterea
noli temetipsum super te inaniter exaltare, quia durum
est tibi contra stimulum calcitrare. Nam qui modo,
quasi parcendo vobis et miserando, vestram terram
cum paucis intrabat, ejus interim gratiam nisi inveneritis</HI> 
 <NOTE N="1713" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> ne
 <HI REND="ITALIC">syllaba al. man. superscr.</HI>  1.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">cito cum tanta multitudine exercituum
superveniet, quibus nec fontes vestri sufficient, et quos
vestra terrula vix capiet; tunc erunt novissima pejora
prioribus. Unde iterum admoneo te et consilium do,
ne totum, quod possidere videris, amittas. Peginam</HI> 
 <NOTE N="1714" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> regina 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">pecuniam</HI> <NOTE N="(464)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0136" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0136C"></COL> Hor., epp. 1, 6, 37.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quae omnia superat, iratos placat,
inimicos reconciliat, per tibi fideles amicos</HI> <NOTE N="1715" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">repetit</HI>  fideles  <HI REND="ITALIC">sed expunxit</HI>  1.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">non modicam caesari mittas, quatenus pro te ipsa
 <COL N="0136C"></COL> intercedat et ejus tibi</HI> <NOTE N="1716" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">omittunt</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">gratiam acquirat.</HI>  Ad haec
dux Bracizlaus ira commotus salubres sprevit monitus,
et innixus manum capulo sic ait:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dicite vestro</HI> 
 <NOTE N="1717" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> viro 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Occardo</HI> <NOTE N="1718" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> Okardo 2,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et deinceps.</HI>  Ockardo 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> :  <HI REND="ITALIC">Consilii satis</HI> <NOTE N="1719" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> satis cons. A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">est mihi, neve</HI> 
 <NOTE N="1720" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> ne 2, ne me 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">monendo profecisse putes. Audiant te</HI> <NOTE N="1721" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> se
4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Saxones
saxis rigidiores, et si qui sunt inconsulti</HI> <NOTE N="1722" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> inconsultu 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">homines,
qui te sapere aliquid putant. Ego autem, nisi
his in tribus diebus hac de mea provincia sine omni
violentia exeas, hoc</HI> <NOTE N="1723" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ense caput tuum abscidam,
et tua ora ponam tibi ad posteriora.</HI></P> <P COM="0136"><HI REND="ITALIC">Caesaris in curte quid agatur, non mihi curae est</HI> <NOTE N="1724" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0135" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0135"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr. al. man.</HI>  A.</NOTE> .
 <COL N="0137A"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Quamdiu in femore Bracizlai pendet ensis, non lac
sed similis fluet sanguis ex latere caesaris.</HI>  Quae cum
 <NOTE N="1725" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> dum 2, 3.</NOTE>  duci <NOTE N="1726" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A. Ockardo  <HI REND="ITALIC">addunt</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  relata fuissent, quamvis nimis aegre id
tulisset, tamen invitus ceu lupus, qui, <NOTE N="1727" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  cum amittit
praedam et investigantibus canibus submittens
caudam repetit silvam, sic dux Occardus cum magno
dedecore repedat in Saxoniam. Item relatum est
duci Bracizlao <NOTE N="1728" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> Bracizlavo 1.</NOTE>  de Pricos <NOTE N="1729" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> Prikos 1. Prycos
2, 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . Picos 3.</NOTE>  comite, qui praefuit
 <NOTE N="1730" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> fuit 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  Beline <NOTE N="1731" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> Belin 1, 2, 4. Bolin 3.</NOTE>  in urbe, quod corruptus Saxonum
pecunia non stetisset ex adverso munitionis in custodia;
sed, ubi sunt nemora hostibus pervia, ibi
posuisset <NOTE N="1732" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> posuissent 1.</NOTE>  praesidia <NOTE N="(465)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137D"></COL> Anno 1043 Eppo est praefectus Bilinensis;
vide tabulam Boczek I, 116.</NOTE> . Hunc enim dux praefecerat
toti <NOTE N="1733" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> tote 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  cohorti quae fuit de Moravia, et tribus
legionibus quae fuerant <NOTE N="1734" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> fuerunt
4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  missae in auxilium
de Ungaria <NOTE N="(466)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137D"></COL> A Petro Ungarorum rege Bracizlai socio.
Quae cum Annales Hildesh. ad annum 1041 referant,
dubitari non potest quin proditio comitis Pricos et
numerus anni 1041 in textu ad II, 11 revocandus
sit.</NOTE> . Quem statim <NOTE N="1735" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  dux <NOTE N="1736" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> Bracizlaus  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  iratus,
 <COL N="0137B"></COL> erutis oculis, manibus et pedibus abscisis, jussit
praecipitari <NOTE N="1737" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> praecipitare 3.</NOTE>  in abyssum <NOTE N="1738" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> abissum 1.</NOTE>  fluminis <NOTE N="1739" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> ad hanc rem
pertinet annus dom. incarn. MXLI,  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> , anno
dominicae incarnationis 1041.</P> <P COM="0137">Imperator Henricus pugnat cum duce Brzieczislao
et turpiter fugatur. 2. 2 <SUP>a</SUP> . 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</P> <P COM="0137">12. Anno dom. inc. 1042 <NOTE N="(467)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137D"></COL> Anno 1041 haec gesta sunt; cfr. Herm. Aug.
et Ann. Sang.</NOTE> . Heinricus imperator,
semper magnificus triumphator, volens ulcisci
suorum ruinam inclitorum, intrat tribus itineribus
terram Boemorum, et eam fere totam hostiliter devastat,
ac multas civitates, quas illi defendere non
valentes deseruerant, igne succendit. Et ut pervenit
ad urbem Pragam, ante ipsam ex adverso fixit aquilas
Sibenica <NOTE N="1740" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> Sibenice 1. Sybenice 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  in monticulo <NOTE N="(468)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137D"></COL> Mons Zizka postea nominatus.</NOTE> . Ibi nichil actum
dignum relatu comperi <NOTE N="1741" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> comperit 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> , nisi quod praesul Severus</P> <P COM="0137"><COL N="0137C"></COL> Caesaris ad castra clam noctu fugit ab urbe,
timens, ut aestimo, ne quasi domino suo rebellis privaretur
sedis honore pontificalis. Quod videns dux
Bracizlaus</P> <P COM="0137">Nescit quid faciat, mentem dolor undique turbat.
Jam poenitet eum olim pugnasse contra caesarem
 <NOTE N="1742" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> jam poenitet—caesarem  <HI REND="ITALIC">omissa</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  jam poenitet eum sprevisse <NOTE N="1743" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">verba</HI>  sprevisse—eum  <HI REND="ITALIC">in marg.</HI>  A.  <HI REND="ITALIC">apposuit alia manus</HI></NOTE>  monita ducis
Occardi, jam mavult <NOTE N="1744" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> maluit 2, 2 <SUP>h</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>  precibus pugnare, et eum
 <NOTE N="1745" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> exsuperare 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  precibus superare <NOTE N="1746" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> nam 2, 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>  quem olim pugnando superarat;
atque his verbis temptat diram deflectere
 <COL N="0138A"></COL> caesaris iram:</P> <P COM="0138"><HI REND="ITALIC">Bella geris, caesar, nullos habitura triumphos</HI> <NOTE N="(469)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137D"></COL> Lucan., Phars. I, 12.</NOTE> .
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Nostra</HI> <NOTE N="1747" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">terra tua est camera, nosque tui sumus,
et esse tui</HI> <NOTE N="1748" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">cupimus. Nam qui suos in subjectos
saevit,</HI></P> <P COM="0138"><HI REND="ITALIC">Hoste crudeli crudelior noscitur esse;
si spectas ad robur tui exercitus, nos tibi nec moment
rerum sumus. Cur ostendis potentiam tuam
quasi contra folium, quod a vento rapitur? Nam
ventus deficit ubi nichil sibi officit. Quod vis</HI> <NOTE N="1749" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> vitrici 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ut
sis, jam victor es,</HI> 

 <POEM COM="0138"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Jam tua jam cinge victricia</HI> <NOTE N="1750" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> timpora 2, 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 4, tempora 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tympora</HI> <NOTE N="1751" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3, 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">lauro</HI> <NOTE N="(470)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0138" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0138D"></COL> Virg., Aen. V, 539.</NOTE> .</L></POEM> 

Insuper ei promittit mille et quingentas marcas denariorum,
 <COL N="0138B"></COL> quod erat tributum trium annorum jam
 <NOTE N="1751" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3, 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP></NOTE>  praeteritorum <NOTE N="(471)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0138" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0138D"></COL> Autumno in festivitate S. Michaelis Heinricum
ad Pragam cum Bohemis pacem fecisse testatur
annalista Saxo a. 1042.</NOTE> .

 <POEM COM="0138"><L>Mox velut insignis cum flammis aestuat ignis,</L></POEM> 

si quis nimiam desuper fundit <NOTE N="1752" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> fundat 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>  aquam, paulatim
impetum ejus confundit, et praevalentibus undis deficit
ignis:

 <POEM COM="0138"><L>Haud secus <NOTE N="1753" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> sexus  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  secus A.</NOTE>  extinxit regina pecunia caesaris iram.</L></POEM> 

Nam qui olim hanc terram intraverat inmitis, accepta
pecunia revertitur mitis, pace interposita.</P> <P COM="0138">13. Anno dominicae incarnationis 1043 tanta fames
fuit in Boemia, ut tercia pars populi interiret
fame.</P> <LIST COM="0138"><ITEM>Anno dominicae incarnationis 1044.</ITEM> <ITEM><COL N="0138C"></COL> Anno dominicae incarnationis 1045. obiit Gunter
monacus 7 Idus Octobris <NOTE N="(472)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0138" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0138D"></COL> De Guntario eremita in silva Bohemica vide
Herm. Aug. 1045; Vitam S. Godehardi ep. Hildesh.
ap. Leibnitium I, 487, et praeceptum Bratislai a.
1045, Boczek I, 120; Vitam S. Guntheri Act. SS.
Oct. IV, 1068.</NOTE> .</ITEM> <ITEM>Anno dominicae incarnationis 1046. dedicatum est
monasterium in urbe Bolezlau 14 Kal. Junii <NOTE N="1754" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0137"></COL> IV Calend. Januarii 3.</NOTE>  a
