cum adjuvante Deo totam sibi subjugasset Poloniam,
nec non bis victor, jam tercia vice proposuerat invadere
Pannoniam <NOTE N="(476)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139D"></COL> Dubitat Palacky I, 291, num Bratislaus revera
bellum contra Ungaros tempore hiemali suscipere
voluerit.</NOTE> , dumque praecedens suum
exspectat exercitum, Hrudim <NOTE N="1765" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> Chrudim 2, Hrudin 3.</NOTE>  in urbe acri pulsatur
 <COL N="0139B"></COL> aegritudine; quam ut sensit magis magisque
ingravescere, et sui corporis vires evanescere, convocat
eos qui forte aderant terrae <NOTE N="1766" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> sui 2.</NOTE>  primates,
quibus astantibus verbis fatur talibus:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quia me
mea fata vocant, et atra mors jam prae oculis volat,
volo vobis assignare et vestrae fidei commendare, qui</HI> <NOTE N="1767" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">erasum et superscr.</HI>  A.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">post me debeat rem publicam gubernare. Vos scitis
quia nostra principalis</HI> <NOTE N="1768" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">genealogia, partim sterilitate,
partim pereuntibus in</HI> <NOTE N="1769" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2, 3, 4,
4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">inmatura aetate, me
usque</HI> <NOTE N="1770" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">corr. al. man.</HI>  A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ad unum</HI> <NOTE N="1771" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> imum 2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fuit redacta. Nunc autem,
ut ipsi cernitis, sunt mihi a Deo dati quinque nati,
inter quos dividere regnum Boemiae non videtur mihi
esse utile, quia omne regnum in seipsum</HI> <NOTE N="1772" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> i. s. ipso  <HI REND="ITALIC">al. man. in margine</HI>  A. apposita.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">divisum
desolabitur. Quia</HI> <NOTE N="1773" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> quod
2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vero ab origine</HI> <NOTE N="1774" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> oriente 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">mundi, et
ab initio Romani imperii, et usque ad haec tempora
 <COL N="0139C"></COL> fuerit fratrum</HI> <NOTE N="1775" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">omissum</HI>  A. 1, 2, 2 <SUP>a</SUP> , 4 <SUP>a</SUP> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">legunt 3, 4, et in margine</HI>  2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">gratia rara, testantur nobis exempla
rata. Nam Cain</HI> <NOTE N="1776" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> Chain 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et Abel, Romulus et Remus,
et mei atavi Bolezlaus et sanctus Wencezlaus, si
spectes quid fecerint</HI> <NOTE N="1777" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> fuerint  <HI REND="ITALIC">pro</HI>  fecerint 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fratres bini, quid facturi sunt
quini</HI> <NOTE N="1778" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> quinterni 3.</NOTE> ?  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hos ergo</HI> <NOTE N="1779" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  1, 4, ego  <HI REND="ITALIC">rell.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">quanto potiores ac potenciores
intueor, tanto mente praesaga pejora augurior.
Heu mens</HI> <NOTE N="1780" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">al. man. superscr.</HI>  1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">semper pavida genitorum de incertis
satis natorum! Unde praevidendum</HI> <NOTE N="1781" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> providendum A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">est ne post mea
fata</HI> <NOTE N="1782" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> facta  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  fata A.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">aliqua inter eos oriatur discordia propter
 <COL N="0140A"></COL> obtinenda regni gubernacula. Qua de re rogo vos per
Dominum</HI> <NOTE N="1783" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> Deum 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et obtestor fidei vestrae per sacramentum,
quatinus inter meos natos sive nepotes semper
major</HI> <NOTE N="1784" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> minor 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">natu summum jus et solium obtineat in
principatu, omnesque</HI> <NOTE N="1785" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> et omnes 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fratres sui, sive qui sunt
orti herili de tribu, sint sub ejus dominatu</HI> <NOTE N="(477)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139D"></COL> Hanc legem Cosmas infra III, 13 vocat  <HI REND="ITALIC">justitiam
Bohemorum.</HI></NOTE> .
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Credite mihi, nisi monarchos</HI> <NOTE N="1786" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> monachos
 <HI REND="ITALIC">al. manu superscr.</HI>  solus 1, nec monarchos 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , si monarcha 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">hunc regat ducatum,
vobis principibus ad jugulum, populo ad magnum deveniet</HI> 
 <NOTE N="1787" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> deveniret  <HI REND="ITALIC">eraso</HI>  r 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">damnum</HI> <NOTE N="(478)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139D"></COL> Hunc rerum ordinem a Bratislao non in
ipsa morte constitutum esse, docet tabula quaedam
a. 1054 scripta, in qua mentio fit Wratislai, filii
ejus, ducis Moraviensis; Boczek I, 130.</NOTE> . Dixerat, et inter astancium
manus corporeos artus linquens petit ethera flatus
ejus 4 Idus Januarii <NOTE N="1788" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(479)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0140" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0140D"></COL> Consentit Necrologium Bohemicum.</NOTE> , ac magnus planctus
est desuper illico factus <NOTE N="1789" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">hoc loco superscr.</HI>  A.</NOTE> . Quantae autem dux iste
Bracizlaus frugalitatis <NOTE N="1790" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> fragilitatis  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  frugilitatis A.</NOTE> , vel quantae discretionis
in divinis legibus <NOTE N="1791" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> regibus 1.</NOTE>  et humanis judiciis, aut quam
largus dator <NOTE N="1792" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> dator  <HI REND="ITALIC">repetit</HI>  1.</NOTE>  elemosinarum et quam pius fautor
 <COL N="0140B"></COL> ecclesiarum sive viduarum fuerit, facundia Tullii
prius defecisset, quam singula ejus quaeque merita
explicuisset <NOTE N="1793" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> explicuissent A.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0140">14. Post cujus obitum filium ejus primogenitum
nomine Spitignev <NOTE N="1794" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> Zpitignev 1, 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , Spitigneu 2, Zpingnen 3, Zpitigneum 4, Spitigneum 4 <SUP>a</SUP> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et sic
porro.</HI></NOTE>  omnes Boemicae gentis, magni
et parvi, communi consilio et voluntate pari eligunt
sibi in ducem <NOTE N="1795" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> judicem  <HI REND="ITALIC">omisso</HI>  in 4 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> , cantantes kirieleison cantilenam
dulcem. Erat enim vir valde speciosus, caesariae pice
nigrior atra, barba <NOTE N="1796" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> barbara  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  barba A.</NOTE>  prolixa, facie laeta <NOTE N="1797" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> lata 4.</NOTE> , genae
ejus candidiores nive, et parum rubentes per medium.
Quid plura?

 <POEM COM="0140"><L>Vir bonus et talos a vertice pulcher ad imos</L></POEM> 

erat <NOTE N="(480)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0140" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0140D"></COL> Hor., epp. II, 2, 4.</NOTE> . Prima <NOTE N="1798" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> autem  <HI REND="ITALIC">inserunt</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  die qua intronizatus est, hic
magnum et mirabile ac omnibus seclis memorabile
fecit hoc sibi memoriale; nam quotquot inventi sunt
 <COL N="0140C"></COL> de gente Teutonica, sive dives, sive pauper, sive <NOTE N="1799" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0139"></COL> seu 4.</NOTE> 
peregrinus, omnes simul in tribus diebus jussit eliminari
de terra Boemia <NOTE N="(481)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0140" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0140D"></COL> Sed non omnes Teutonicos expulit e Bohemia,
potius Vitum abbatem Sazaviensem Slavica
natione oriundum munere privavit, et abbatem Teutonicum
in monasterium induxit, ut refert monachus
Sazaviensis.</NOTE> , quin etiam et genitricem
non tulit remanere suam, de qua supra
meminimus <NOTE N="(482)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0140" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0140D"></COL> I, 40.</NOTE> , Ottonis natam, nomine Juditham.
Similiter et abbatissam <NOTE N="(483)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0140" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0140D"></COL> Dobner V, 329 ex diplomate quodam Ottocari
I effecisse videtur ei nomen Adlaidae fuisse</NOTE>  sancti Georgii, Brunonis
filiam, eliminat, quia haec olim antea eum verbis
offenderat acerbis. Nam dum pater ejus Bracizlaus
reaedificaret moenia tocius urbis Pragae per girum,
 <COL N="0141A"></COL> et hic <NOTE N="1800" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> haec 1.</NOTE>  supradictus heros a patre sibi concessam
Satec <NOTE N="1801" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> Satc 2, Satcz 2. Sate 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , Sathec 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  haberet <NOTE N="1802" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> h  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr. al. man.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  provinciam, forte <NOTE N="1803" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> sorte 2, 4.</NOTE>  exiit ut
cum suis circa sancti Georgii claustrum componeret
murum. Et cum nullo modo recte poni posset
murus, nisi destrueretur fornax abbatissae qui ibi
 <NOTE N="1804" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  A.  <HI REND="ITALIC">omittunt</HI>  4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  forte stabat, jactata fune in media, tunc aliis
hoc facere cunctantibus, accessit natus herilis, et
quasi risum sibi faciens, cum magno cachinno <NOTE N="1805" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> chachinno 1, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
jussit eum dejicere subito in torrentem Bruzincam
 <NOTE N="1806" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> Brusnicam 1, Bruznicam 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP>  Brucitucam
3.</NOTE> , dicens:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hodie domina abbatissa calidas non gustabit
placentas.</HI>  Quod agnoscens abbatissa exiit
irata de claustro, et valde moleste ejus dicta ferens,
sic eum yronicis aggreditur et confundit dictis:

 <POEM COM="0141"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Nobilis, insignis, vir fortis et inclitus armis,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Quam magnas turres nunc expugnavit et urbes,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC"><COL N="0141B"></COL> Et sibi famosum fert de fornace triumphum,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Timpora jam lauro victricia cingat et auro.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Clerus multimodas campanis</HI> <NOTE N="1807" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> campanas  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  campanis A. campanas 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">personet</HI> <NOTE N="1808" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> personat 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">odas,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Dux quia dejecit</HI> <NOTE N="1809" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> dejicit 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fornacem miraque fecit.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Ah</HI> <NOTE N="1810" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> Ach 4.</NOTE> !  <HI REND="ITALIC">pudet effari</HI> <NOTE N="1811" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> ea fari 4, 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">quae non pudet hunc operari.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Corpore diriguit vir, vox et faucibus haesit</HI> <NOTE N="(484)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141D"></COL> Virg., Aen. III, 48.</NOTE> ,</L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Indignansque</HI> <NOTE N="1812" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> n  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr.</HI>  1, indignamque 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">suam gemitu compescuit iram</HI> <NOTE N="(485)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141D"></COL> Lucan., Phars. IX, 166.</NOTE> .</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0141">Haec quoniam <NOTE N="1813" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> quum 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>  abbatissae dicta dux alta in
mente reposita <NOTE N="(486)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141D"></COL> Virg., Aen. I, 26.</NOTE>  reservarat <NOTE N="1814" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> reservaret 1.</NOTE> , postquam est
intronizatus, priusquam <NOTE N="1815" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> pq 1.</NOTE>  sancti Georgii ecclesiam
intrarat <NOTE N="1816" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> intrat A, intraret 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> , ad  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  1.</NOTE> , abbatissam expellit <NOTE N="1817" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  A.  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscripsit alia manus et coaeva illa; deest in rell.</HI></NOTE>  mandans sibi
talia <NOTE N="1818" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> 3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">sic legit:</HI>  abbatissae mandat talia.</NOTE> :  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nunc potius convenit clerum resonare
odas et pulsare campanas, cum abbatissa foras et</HI> <NOTE N="1819" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">omittunt</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">de terra hac ejicitur</HI> <NOTE N="1820" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> ejicitur d. t. A.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quam cum fornax ejus dejicitur.
Ecce vir fortis et inclitus armis non turres, non
 <COL N="0141C"></COL> urbes expugnando, sed te abbatissam</HI> <NOTE N="1821" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> m  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr. al. manu</HI> 
A. abbatissa 3.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">illius fornacis</HI> 
 <NOTE N="1822" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> n  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr.</HI>  1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">dominam, hodie ejiciendo</HI> <NOTE N="1823" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> ejici ipio 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fert</HI> <NOTE N="1824" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">famosum
triumphum, et cingit timpora lauro.</HI>  Et ut
