A.</NOTE>  ad primates litteras, in quibus
nominatim vocat trecentos viros, quos ipse
novit <NOTE N="1831" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> vidit 2.</NOTE>  meliores et nobiliores <NOTE N="1832" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> et nobiliores  <HI REND="ITALIC">omissa</HI>  4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  ex omnibus civitatibus,
et ut sibi ad urbem Hrudim <NOTE N="1833" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> Grudim 1.</NOTE>  occurrerent
 <NOTE N="1834" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  A. occurrant  <HI REND="ITALIC">rell.</HI></NOTE> , per salutem capitis sui mandat. Jussa viri
