Grutov <NOTE N="1836" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141"></COL> Grutou 2, 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . Chruton 3. Grothou 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(488)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0141" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0141D"></COL> Campi Grutauvienses, ultra Chrudim oppidum
