 <COL N="0170B"></COL> silvam, qua Milcianorum</HI> <NOTE N="2426" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> Milcanorum 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(586)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0170" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0170C"></COL> In Lusatia superiori; cfr. Thietmar. I, 9.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">occurrunt termini.
Inde ad orientem hos fluvios habet terminos: Bug</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2427" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> Buo 7.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(587)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0170" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0170C"></COL> Bug.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">scilicet</HI> <NOTE N="2428" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> feliciter 1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et Ztir</HI> <NOTE N="2429" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> Ztiz 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . Zur 4 <SUP>a</SUP></NOTE>   <NOTE N="(588)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0170" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0170C"></COL> Styr qui in fluvium Bipetz exundat.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">cum Cracova</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2430" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> Krakova 1. Krakovia 2. Krakoua 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . 7, Cracoua 3. Chracoua 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">civitate provinciaque cui Vag</HI> <NOTE N="2431" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI> 
A. Wag  <HI REND="ITALIC">rell.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nomen est, cum
omnibus regionibus ad praedictam urbem pertinentibus,
quae Cracova</HI> <NOTE N="2432" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> Krakow 2, 2 <SUP>b</SUP> , 3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">est. Inde Ungarorum</HI> <NOTE N="2433" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0169" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0169"></COL> Ungariorum 4, 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">limitibus
additis usque ad montes, quibus nomen est
