 <NOTE N="3618" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0225" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0225"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>  ad <NOTE N="3619" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0225" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0225"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  1, in  <HI REND="ITALIC">rell.</HI></NOTE>  gratiam, et dat ei civitatem Gradec et
