Pegaviensi.</NOTE> ,
fratre vero ejus juniore Lutoldo olim antea similiter
 <COL N="0226C"></COL> ab hac luce subtracto, filiis autem illorum <NOTE N="3626" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0225" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0225"></COL> eorum 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
adhuc aetate parvulis, dux Wladizlaus germano suo
