2, 4, Luzko 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(747)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227D"></COL> Ut Palacky I, 380 conjicit, apud Hluk inter
