puer rex</HI>   <CITN>(Eccle. X, 16)</CITN> , principes <NOTE N="3639" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  ejus per innatam
sibi superbiam aberrantes, ad pacifica ducis
verba remittunt <NOTE N="3640" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> rem. verba resp. A.</NOTE>  responsa magis rixam provocantia
