fortes <NOTE N="3652" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">supersc. al. manu</HI>  A.</NOTE>  accipientes cohortes <NOTE N="3653" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> choortes 1.</NOTE> , circuierunt <NOTE N="3654" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> circumierunt
3.</NOTE> 
monticulum qui eos forte dirimebat, et repente
