in castris <NOTE N="3662" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> pontem Belin  <HI REND="ITALIC">al. man. superscr.</HI>  A Belun  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  Belin 1. Bebin 3. Belin 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  regis—jam enim ultra pontem Belim
 <NOTE N="3663" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> regis
 <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  A.</NOTE>  posita erant castra <NOTE N="3663" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> regis
 <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  A.</NOTE>  in campis,—aestimantes
hostiles acies adhuc se insequi, multo plures submersi
