usque ad annum 1116.</NOTE> ,
cujus humilitatem jam Dominus <NOTE N="3671" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> Deus 3.</NOTE>  prospectans <NOTE N="3672" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr. al. man.</HI>  1.</NOTE> 
arcis de throno ethere <NOTE N="3673" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> ete 1.</NOTE> , misertus erat afflictionis
ejus et miseriae, et quia cui <NOTE N="3674" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> cujus 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  Deus <NOTE N="3675" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> misertus—Deus  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  3.</NOTE>  miseretur
homo non potest non misereri, statim praedictus dux
 <COL N="0228C"></COL> jam nutu instinctus divino et Hermanni episcopi faciens
omnia consilio <NOTE N="3676" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> cum cons. A.</NOTE> , mittit et revocat mense
Decembri fratrem suum Borivoy de exilio, et satisfaciens
sibi ac semetipsum <NOTE N="3677" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> semet 4.</NOTE>  ejus submittens dominio,
iterum collocat eum in principali solio. O
mira ducis benignitas, sed magis admiranda aequanimitas,
quem nec secularis delectat dignitas, nec
contristat posita honoris sublimitas!

 <POEM COM="0228"><L>Juvit sumpta ducem, juvit dimissa potestas.</L> <L>Talia quis unquam <NOTE N="3678" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>  audivit, dic rogo, facta?</L></POEM> 

Utinam haec audiret Colomannus <NOTE N="3679" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0227" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0227"></COL> Cholomannus 1. Kolmannus 4. Colmannus  <HI REND="ITALIC">rell.</HI></NOTE>  rex Pannonicus,
si viveret! qui metuens ne germanus suus Almus
 <COL N="0229A"></COL> post eum regnaret, ipsum et filium ejus mentula
privavit et lumine <NOTE N="(752)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229D"></COL> Cfr. Vita S. Ottonis ep. Bamberg, III, 42.</NOTE> . Borivoy autem <NOTE N="3680" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>  non
immemor accepti beneficii, dat fratri suo dimidiam
sui ducatus partem, quae sita <NOTE N="3681" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">al. man.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  ultra fluvium
Labe <NOTE N="3682" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr. al. atram.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  tendit ad aquilonem, eratque fratri suo
licet juniori <NOTE N="3683" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Wladizlaus  <HI REND="ITALIC">inserunt</HI>  4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  in omnibus obediens, et semper <NOTE N="3684" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> honore
 <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
eum praeveniens nichil sine suo <NOTE N="3685" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  3.</NOTE>  consilio
