super pontem excrevit.</P> <P COM="0229">45. Anno dominicae incarnationis 1119, 3. Kal.
Augusti, feria vero quarta, cum esset jam inclinata
 <NOTE N="3691" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> inclita A.</NOTE>  dies, ventus <NOTE N="3692" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  vehemens, immo ipse Satan in
turbine ab australi plaga repente irruens super solarium
ducis in urbe Wissegrad, antiquum murum et
eo firmissimum funditus snbvertit. Et inde magis est
admirandum, ex <NOTE N="3693" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">delet</HI>  A.</NOTE>  utraque parte anteriori et posteriori
integra et inconcussa manente, medietas
palacii solotenus est eruta, et cicius quam tu festucam
frangeres, trabes inferiores et superiores simul
 <NOTE N="3694" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  A.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest
rell.</HI></NOTE>  cum ipsa domo impetus venti fregit in
frusta et dispersit <NOTE N="3695" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> discerpsit 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> . Fuit autem haec tempestas
 <COL N="0229C"></COL> adeo valida, ut quacunque parte incubuit, hujus terrae
silvas et arbores plantatas <NOTE N="3696" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> plantas 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  et caetera sibi
obstantia suo <NOTE N="3697" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  3.</NOTE>  impetu prostravit.</P> <P COM="0229">46. Anno dominicae incarnationis 1120.

 <POEM COM="0229"><L>Nunc, mea Musa, tuum digito compesce labellum.</L> <L>Si bene docta sapis, caveas ne vera <NOTE N="3698" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> falsa  <HI REND="ITALIC">in margine ab alia manu</HI>  2.</NOTE>  loquaris,</L> <L>Ut mecum sapias, breviter solummodo dicas:</L> <L>Est Borivoy rursus regni <NOTE N="3699" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> regis
2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  de culmine pulsus.</L> <L>Augusti quarta <NOTE N="3700" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> quarto 3.</NOTE>  post Idus sunt ea facta.</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0229">47. Anno dominicae incarnationis 1121, nimis <NOTE N="3701" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> nimio 3.</NOTE> 
attenuatae sunt segetes propter nimiam siccitatem,
quae fuit per tres <NOTE N="3702" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A.</NOTE>  continuos <NOTE N="3703" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> contiguos 1.</NOTE>  menses, Marcium
scilicet et Aprilem atque Maium.</P> <P COM="0229">Eodem <NOTE N="3704" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ab hoc loco usque ad vocem</HI>  Zuratka
 <HI REND="ITALIC">omnia desunt</HI>  4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  anno dux Wladizlaus reaedificavit <NOTE N="3705" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> reaedificat 2 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <COL N="0230A"></COL> oppidum Donin <NOTE N="3706" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Douin 3.</NOTE> , similiter et Podwin <NOTE N="3707" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Podwin 2. Podiwin 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . Podiuin 3.</NOTE>  astrum,
quod est in <NOTE N="3708" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
A.</NOTE>  Moravia <NOTE N="3709" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Moravie A.</NOTE>  situm infra havium
Zuratka <NOTE N="3710" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Zuracka 3.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0230">48. Eodem anno quidam ex Teutonicis <NOTE N="3711" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Theutoni. 2.</NOTE>  infra
terminos Boemorum in silva, ad quam itur per villam
Bela, in praerupta <NOTE N="3712" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> interrupta 3.</NOTE>  rupe aedificant <NOTE N="3713" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> aedificavit 2. 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . 3.</NOTE>  castrum.
Quod <NOTE N="3714" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Quod audiens—castrum  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE>  audiens dux Wladizlaus <NOTE N="3715" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  A.</NOTE>  acceptis
tribus scaris ex electis militibus, repente ex
improviso irruens obtinuit castrum <NOTE N="3714" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Quod audiens—castrum  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE> , ubi in primo
accessu missis de muro sagittis vulnerati sunt, non
tamen ad mortem, duo milites ducis, Oudalricus <NOTE N="3716" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Odaldicus 2.</NOTE> 
filius Wacemil <NOTE N="3717" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Waczemil 2. Wacemi 2b.
Vecenul  <HI REND="ITALIC">omisso sequenti</HI>  et 3.</NOTE>  et Olen filius Borsa. Illos autem
Teutonicos, qui erant in castro capti, nisi comes
Albertus <NOTE N="3718" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> Adalbertus 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  superveniens multis precibus et innata
sibi sagacitate liberasset, procul dubio jam dux <NOTE N="3719" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> jam dux  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  2. Wladizlaus  <HI REND="ITALIC">inserunt</HI>  4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <COL N="0230B"></COL> in eadem silva omnes suspendi jusserat.</P> <P COM="0230">Ejusdem anni <NOTE N="3720" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> eodem anno 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  fuit hiemps nimis ventosa <NOTE N="3721" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> ventuosa 2. 4. 4 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
et calida et aquarum inundatio magna.</P> <P COM="0230">49. Anno dominicae incarnationis 1122, 9 Kal.
 <NOTE N="3722" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0229" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0229"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  A. 1. 2. 2 <SUP>b</SUP> . 3.</NOTE>  Aprilis, fuit eclipsis lunae media nocte, qua Judaicum
